                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "decline_wasting",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "If you do not exercise your muscles, they will gradually begin to <w>atrophy</w>."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Her memory started to <w>atrophy</w> after years of social isolation."
